      "source": [
        "# Section 9: Business Feature Engineering\n",
        "\n",
        "The statistical features created in the previous section summarize the operational behavior of each product. However, supply chain risk is influenced not only by absolute quantities but also by operational efficiency, demand fluctuations, production gaps, and delivery performance.\n",
        "\n",
        "In this section, several business-oriented features are engineered to better represent the operational health of each product. These features will later be used for computing the product risk score and will also serve as node features for the Graph Neural Network."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "u5D_hD8DSM_0"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "eps = 1e-6\n",
        "product_features[\"ProductionEfficiency\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalProduction\"] /\n",
        "    (product_features[\"TotalSales\"] + eps)\n",
        ")\n",
        "product_features[\"DeliveryEfficiency\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalDelivery\"] /\n",
        "    (product_features[\"TotalSales\"] + eps)\n",
        ")\n",
        "product_features[\"FactoryIssueRatio\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalFactoryIssue\"] /\n",
        "    (product_features[\"TotalProduction\"] + eps)\n",
        ")\n",
        "product_features[\"SalesGap\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalSales\"] -\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalDelivery\"]\n",
        ")\n",
        "product_features[\"ProductionGap\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalProduction\"] -\n",
        "    product_features[\"TotalSales\"]\n",
        ")\n",
        "product_features[\"SalesCV\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"StdSales\"] /\n",
        "    (product_features[\"AvgSales\"] + eps)\n",
        ")\n",
        "product_features[\"ProductionCV\"] = (\n",
        "    product_features[\"StdProduction\"] /\n",
        "    (product_features[\"AvgProduction\"] + eps)\n",
        ")"
      ]
    },
