        "# Section 11: Risk Score Generation using PCA\n",
        "\n",
        "The dataset does not contain predefined risk labels for products.\n",
        "\n",
        "Instead of manually assigning weights to operational metrics, Principal Component Analysis (PCA) is used to combine multiple business indicators into a single composite Risk Score.\n",
        "\n",
        "This approach allows the data itself to determine the importance of each feature, making the generated risk score objective and scientifically justifiable."
      ]
    },
