        "## Chronological Data Split & Feature/Target Window Engineering\n",
        "\n",
        "To eliminate data leakage, we separate our temporal dataset chronologically.\n",
        "* **Feature Window:** First 150 days (used to compute node features and construct graph relationships).\n",
        "* **Target Window:** Remaining 71 days (used to compute actual observed risk events, such as delivery shortfalls relative to sales demand)."
      ]
    },
