        "\n",
        "#  Section 32: GCN-only models v2 (less smoothing, validation-based epochs and threshold)\n",
        "# One GCN layer with self-loop weight 2, a skip from the product's own features, DropEdge and dropout.\n",
        "# With `layers=0` the same class is a graph-free network, which gives a like-for-like control."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "1Ma_6eWiwFuv"
