        "# ## Section 34: Features v3 (lagged snapshot) and a feature-similarity graph\n",
        "# The lag features give the model the last snapshot's state and the change since then.\n",
        "# The similarity graph links each product to its 5 most similar products in the SAME snapshot (features only, never labels).\n",
